        "name": "娜布·玛莉卡塔",
        "desc": "<p>花神，大慈树王与赤王的挚友。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/07/31/59155606/df77c80b17526e9aa7c4e365b369b21d_6115228951106138458.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "镇灵是娜布•玛莉卡塔的眷属，诞生于她的伤口。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7075,
        "name": "镇灵",
        "desc": "<p>花神的眷属，生自迷醉的梦乡与失却的苦涩记忆。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/02/326985891/070db3715b0d3f563668130e950ff6cb_4930111596472171630.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "利露帕尔是镇灵之母。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4911,
        "name": "阿赫玛尔",
        "desc": "<p>须弥三神王之一，曾经统治古代大地四方的君王。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/07/31/59155606/df77c80b17526e9aa7c4e365b369b21d_2833919335886584962.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "在娜布•玛莉卡塔辞世后，镇灵们效忠赤王阿赫玛尔。\n奥尔玛兹\n一位在利露帕尔的影响下，成为了居尔城统治者的牧童。\n希琳\n利露帕尔的女儿。\n基斯拉•帕维兹拉万\n利露帕尔的儿子。\n希鲁伊\n利露帕尔的外孙，希琳和基斯拉的儿子。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3527,
        "name": "芭别尔",
        "desc": "<ol><li><p><span>塔尼特部族的主母。</span></p></li></ol>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/11/88072335/e3ada2f7642f67aa52b067345fae5a54_6199288835786211939.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "塔尼特部族想要利用利露帕尔去寻找「永恒绿洲」。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 20,
        "name": "旅行者",
        "desc": "从世界之外漂流而来的旅行者，被神带走血亲，自此踏上寻找七神之路。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/04f769b0b1671b5ffbbafefd7286b4b2_8705621070531496665.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "利露帕尔的主人，她把自己的真名托付给了他。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
